  "post_content": "<p>El Pabell&oacute;n V&iacute;ctor Cabedo Carda acoge este s&aacute;bado el Open Internacional Vila d&#39;Onda de Brazilian Jiu Jitsu, en el que participan&nbsp;197 luchadores pertenecientes a clubs de toda Europa, incluso de Suecia.</p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2013/11/IMG_0751.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px\" /></p>\n<p>La prueba est&aacute; organizada por el gimansio Kubotan de Onda, cuyo club de lucha obtiene excelentes resultados en Espa&ntilde;a y en Europa, principalmente con Juan Garc&iacute;a Garrido, Esther Gil Robles y Nazar Vintonyak.</p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/openinternacionalbjjvilaonda13/img_0748.jpg\" alt=\"img_0748\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/openinternacionalbjjvilaonda13/img_0749.jpg\" alt=\"img_0749\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/openinternacionalbjjvilaonda13/img_0750.jpg\" alt=\"img_0750\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/openinternacionalbjjvilaonda13/img_0751.jpg\" alt=\"img_0751\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/openinternacionalbjjvilaonda13/img_0752.jpg\" alt=\"img_0752\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/openinternacionalbjjvilaonda13/img_0753.jpg\" alt=\"img_0753\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/openinternacionalbjjvilaonda13/img_0755.jpg\" alt=\"img_0755\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/openinternacionalbjjvilaonda13/img_0756.jpg\" alt=\"